  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "f1",
      "kind": "gap",
      "elements": [
        "coherence.judge.touched",
        "coherence.verify.stale"
      ],
      "text": "For an element a touched element depends on, judge records only its fingerprints now, not in the baseline. A mainline merge can change the baseline of such an element (for example `lint.step` under `lint.run.exit`). Then the change that reaches the dependent element is different, yet nothing recorded for the dependent changes, so it is not reported stale. This is against verify.stale's Rationale that the check holds for 'the baseline it read it against'.",
      "status": "resolved",
      "reason": "edited in 7786aa6"
    },
    {
      "id": "f2",
      "kind": "gap",
      "elements": [
        "coherence.judge.touched"
      ],
      "text": "For a removed touched element, the rule does not say in which tree its dependencies are followed: the element exists only in the baseline, while the Examples imply the current tree for changed elements.",
      "status": "resolved",
      "reason": "edited in 7786aa6"
    },
    {
      "id": "f3",
      "kind": "gap",
      "elements": [
        "coherence.verify.stale"
      ],
      "text": "The row where `system.ref.commonmark` gets a new `Contact` after the check expects 'nothing reported'. But that makes `system.ref.commonmark` a touched element changed after the check, which the row `lint.run.root, touched only after the check` reports as stale. The outcome holds only for `lint.run.exit` and does not say so.",
      "status": "resolved",
      "reason": "edited in 7786aa6"
    },
    {
      "id": "f4",
      "kind": "gap",
      "elements": [
        "coherence.verify.stale"
      ],
      "text": "The row where `lint.guard` 'is reworded after the check' does not name the part that changed. Its 'stale' outcome holds only if that part is one `change_effects` gives 'dependents' for. A change to `Contact` alone would give 'nothing reported', as the `system.ref.commonmark` row shows.",
      "status": "resolved",
      "reason": "edited in 7786aa6"
    }
  ]
}
